# Copy to frontend/.env. Never commit frontend/.env.
#
# Leave this unset to run without accounts: no sign-in screen, and the backend
# treats every request as the single local user. Set it and the app requires a
# real Clerk account -- the backend must have CLERK_ISSUER set to match.
#
# From https://dashboard.clerk.com -> your app -> API Keys -> Publishable key.
# This key is public by design; it ships in the browser bundle.
# VITE_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=pk_test_...

# Optional tip jar. A Stripe Payment Link, created at
# https://dashboard.stripe.com -> Payment links -> Create link.
#
# Unset (the default) means no button renders at all. The URL is public by design and
# ships in the bundle; there is no secret key here and no webhook. Stripe hosts the
# payment page, so the app never sees card details and never learns who paid.
#
# Inlined at BUILD time like every VITE_ variable. Set it in the build step, not in the
# hosted server's environment -- by then dist/ is already compiled and the button is gone.
# VITE_STRIPE_TIP_URL=https://buy.stripe.com/...
